{"title": "blocked 的作用：删掉它就见分晓", "lines": [
  {"t": "config", "s": "valid_referers none blocked yourwebsite.com;"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -sI -H 'Referer;' localhost | head -1"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "空头请求按 blocked 声明放行"},
  {"t": "config", "s": "valid_referers none yourwebsite.com;   # 删掉 blocked"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -sI -H 'Referer;' localhost | head -1"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "HTTP/1.1 403 Forbidden"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "同一请求立刻被判盗链：这就是 blocked 兜的底"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx:alpine 容器 (nginx/1.31.5)"}
]}
